Package: jarticr
Type: Package
Title: Read and Tidy Japan Road Traffic Information Center Open Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Shinya", family = "Uryu", email = "suika1127@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cph", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0493-6186"))
    )
Description: Reads the cross-sectional traffic volume files ("type B" open
    data) published by the Japan Road Traffic Information Center (JARTIC,
    <https://www.jartic.or.jp>) and returns them as tidy tables. The raw files
    are distributed per prefecture as CP932-encoded CSV without a header row;
    this package handles the encoding, column naming and type conversion, and
    provides helpers to derive an observation-location table and to look up the
    data providers.
